 "text": "\nIntroduction\nThis document lists the equipment \n inspection steps I1 of single stage horizontal centrifugal pump \n which must be performed every 2 and 6 months as indicated by M2, M6 in \n the title block.\nThe first draft initiated by \neng. Hesham M. Hassan, reviewed by director eng. Saad Mostafa, and revised by \nquality control eng. Samir Abdel Gelil at EDEPCo., accepted by general director eng. Ali Al-Lithy\nand approved by eng. Mostafa Alam: Head Sector of Talkha Steam \n Power Station 2x210MW\nTechnical Specification of these PUMP\n\nSafety Precautions\nIsolate the \ncircuit breaker for the motor of this pump.\nIsolate the \nelectrical cable feeding of the motor of this pump.\nThe pump must \nbe isolated mechanically by closing suction and delivery\nvalve.\nA work \n permit must be issued, the qualified maintenance staff should carry the \n suitable safety category,\nSafety \n fence (rope) with caution marks surrounding the work area,\nWear your safety helmet, shoes .... etc\nIsolate the \ncircuit breaker for the motor of this pump.\nIsolate the \nelectrical cable feeding of the motor of this pump.\nThe pump must \nbe isolated mechanically by closing suction and delivery\nvalve.\nTools and Equipment\nComplete \nmaintenance tool set, feeler gauge, suitable lifting device.\nCleaning \nfluid, Manual puller.\nComplete \nmaintenance tool set, feeler gauge, suitable lifting device.\nCleaning \nfluid, Manual puller.\nWork\nto be Carried Out\nInspection every 2 month\nBefore isolated the pump mechanically and electrically\n\nNotes: \n.........................................................................................................................................................\n.........................................................................................................................................................\n....................................................................................................................